Subject: [PATCH CANDIDATE] simple: rotate the SP11 rear processed CPU stream

Candidate for libcamera v0.7.2; requires rear DT rotation = <180>.
The exact OV13858 path and model plus mounting metadata select CPU SoftISP.
Only a single processed stream requested upright is rotated, and its
negotiated orientation is upright. RAW and mixed requests remain native;
sensor transforms, if available, take precedence. The front is unchanged.
No private tuning or hardware register is included. Test on the safe entry
with an asymmetric target before promotion. See the camera test plan.

